DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ggeemmttooppnnmm  reads  a GEM .img file, either the one plane (black/white) or
       four plane (16 color) varieety, as input and produces a PBM or PPM file
       as output, depending on whether the input is one or four plane.

       The input file is _g_e_m_f_i_l_e if you specify that argument, or Standard In‐
       put otherwise.  Output is to Standard Output.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In addition to the options common to all programs  based  on  libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common  Options  ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), ggeemmttooppnnmm recognizes the
       following command line option:



       --dd     Produce output describing the contents of the .img file.




